{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026wuMg4PZa6X1794809632.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>元朗區議員施駿興與女童非法性交罪成，判監兩年半，施駿興提出上訴。</p><p></p><p>施駿興就定罪和判刑向高等法院上訴庭提出上訴，暫時未排期。</p><p></p><p>案情指39歲的施駿興2008年任話劇導師助手，結識當時11歲、讀小學的事主。之後二人發展成情侶，並在2011年發生性行為。</p><p></p><p>施駿興早前在區域法院審訊後，被裁定與16歲以下女童非法性交罪名成立，判監兩年半，另一項非禮罪就不成立。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T06:54:13.254292+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":175,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T05:05:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T19:15:38.399871+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T06:47:35.323119+00:00","content_hash":"239bb0a8c88890cb42a8097f17b2716e5dad3bcbfc13a715192aea60e761f372","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T06:54:13.254292+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}